  "editor_review": "Prepare to step into a chilling cartoon world! Bendy and the Ink Machine™ is a first-person game filled with puzzle-solving, action, and horror elements that will keep you captivated. You assume the role of Henry, the former chief animator at Joey Drew Studios, who receives an enigmatic call to revisit the old animation studio. As you delve deeper into the chaos, you'll face combat, fear, intricate puzzles, and stealth challenges, along with concealed secrets that will keep you intrigued. With a stunning cartoon universe crafted by a passionate indie team, and an enthusiastic global community to connect with, this game truly has it all. Are you ready to confront the shadows, elude the Ink Demon, and dread the Machine?",
